        "text": "The town library normally closes at six in the evening. On Tuesdays the library closes at eight instead. The library has a reading room, a small archive, and a desk for returning books. Visitors can borrow three books at a time. The building is next to the station and across from the bakery. The staff update the opening-hours sign every Monday. A visitor is planning a Tuesday evening visit. On Tuesday, the library closes at eight in the evening, so the visitor can arrive after six."
