      },
      {
        "id": "changed-fact",
        "text": "The archive originally listed the meeting in Room Four. A later update moved it to Room Seven. The meeting begins at ten on Wednesday morning. Participants should bring a notebook and the printed agenda. The hallway has signs for the cafeteria, the lecture hall, and the office. The old room assignment remains in the first draft, but the revised notice is the current source. A participant asks where the meeting will take place. The revised notice says Room Seven is the meeting room, replacing the earlier assignment to Room Four."
      }
